WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.135
I used to listen to music on YouTube Music,

2
00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:07.000
but ads kept popping up all the time — ads, ads, ads.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.837
And a lot of times, if I liked a song,

4
00:00:10.837 --> 00:00:16.290
I liked to hear it slow, fast, ultra slow, ultra fast.

5
00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:20.217
And plenty of other times I only wanted the thirty

6
00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:23.595
seconds in the middle, or the first twenty,

7
00:00:23.595 --> 00:00:27.679
the best part at the end — and of course I played it

8
00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:29.878
again, and again, and again.
